nasty":"明"}},{"title":"新年试笔","author":"陈献章","text":"舍下水生春水开，竹间波弄碧洄洄。\n东风日日江门道，不尽官船打鼓来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42247,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对影","author":"陈献章","text":"风月情真诗浩荡，江湖水阔蓑飘翩。\n丹青不是江门影，又画瞿昙又画仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42248,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中偶得","author":"陈献章","text":"高浪张灯何处船，客边风雨夜如年。\n行人自有明朝路，莫遣阴晴不属天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42249,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陶宪长画唐诗图","author":"陈献章","text":"诗中之画画中诗，晴雪孤舟荡晚晖。\n同在五湖烟水内，是鸱夷不是鸱夷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42250,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后观园","author":"陈献章","text":"二月平原水乱流，微茫生意盎初浮。\n黄茅翠甲惊人眼，是我曾无为草忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42251,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佥宪莆阳李公自海南征黎过白沙","author":"陈献章","text":"蛇窟纵横木短弓，霜风何处捲飞蓬。\n清时欲献征黎颂，血刃犹誇甲胄雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42252,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮名酒","author":"陈献章","text":"徐孺眼欺湖水碧，庞公心死鹿门深。\